cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this repository by its URL and the commit used."
title: "Quantum Capture Limits"
authors:
  - family-names: Lin
    given-names: Ruge
    email: gogoko699@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/GoGoKo699/Quantum-Capture-Limits"
url: "https://github.com/GoGoKo699/Quantum-Capture-Limits"
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  Analytical channel-simulation and communication limits for a two-level
  receiver with bounded coupling and fixed Markov loss and dephasing.
  Vacuum-plus-one-photon temporal encodings permit an exact input-preprocessing
  comparison with maximum coupling, an all-mode zero-capacity boundary,
  and capacity bounds per independently reset use. Includes continuum proofs,
  a learning route from the SLH input-output framework, and independently
  organized numerical checks.
keywords:
  - quantum capture
  - single-photon absorption
  - quantum input-output theory
  - SLH framework
  - temporal-mode encoding
  - two-level receiver
  - bounded coupling
  - Markov dephasing
  - quantum channel simulation
  - antidegradability
  - quantum capacity
